# An allow-list: nothing enters the build context — .git/, the .env files, .sillage/ and every
# worktree under it — but the paths docker/app.Dockerfile and docker/admin.Dockerfile copy.
*
!.cargo/config.toml
!Cargo.lock
!Cargo.toml
!crates
!frontend
!i18n
!player-js
!tauri/Cargo.toml
!tauri/build.rs
!tauri/src
!xtask

# What the allowed paths hold but the images build themselves: build outputs, dependencies,
# the engine and the catalogues copied into the app, test reports.
**/.angular
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/playwright-report
**/target
**/test-results
frontend/projects/app/public/engine
frontend/projects/app/public/i18n
frontend/projects/app/src/app/engine/wasm/generated
